{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25751","headline":"长安少年行 五 · 李廓","name":"长安少年行 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遨游携艳妓，装束似男儿。\n盃酒逢花住，笙歌簇马吹。\n莺声催曲忽，春色送归迟。\n不以闻街鼓，华筵待月移。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李廓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25751.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25751","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}